### **2. Executive Summary:**

Bombay Burmah Trading Employees Welfare Company Limited (BBTEWCL), incorporated on September 24, 1983, under CIN U74999MH1983PLC030940, is a public unlisted company based in Mumbai, India. The company operates within the business services sector. The current investment opportunity involves exploring strategic partnerships or stake acquisitions to leverage BBTEWCL's longstanding presence in the industry. As of the financial year ending March 31, 2022, the company reported revenue of ₹3.24 lakh. citeturn0search1

